{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51990","headline":"别毛明素 · 法琳","name":"别毛明素","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叔夜嗟幽愤，陈思苦责躬。\n在余今失候，枉与古人同。\n草深难见日，松迥易来风。\n因言得意者，谁复免穷通？\n（《大正新修大藏经》第五十册唐释彦悰撰《唐护法沙门法琳别传》卷中。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法琳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}